  "body": "* Single-level home on a 378 sqm section with a 188 sqm floor area\r\n* 4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and two living areas\r\n* Light-filled, open-plan kitchen, dining and living area with high-set windows\r\n* Modern kitchen with a timber-look island and electric cooktop\r\n* Separate secondary kitchen with a gas cooktop\r\n* Main bedroom with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n* Seamless indoor-outdoor flow to a timber deck\r\n* Bathroom featuring a freestanding bathtub\r\n* Central speaker system and underfloor heating\r\n* Separate laundry\r\n* Double internal-access garage\r\n* 10-year building warranty\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed for modern family living, this single-level Orewa home combines contemporary style, natural light and a practical layout. Set on a 378 sqm section with a 188 sqm floor area, the home offers four bedrooms, two bathrooms and two living areas.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, high-set windows fill the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area with natural light, creating a bright and welcoming atmosphere. The modern kitchen combines crisp white cabinetry with a timber-look island, offering both style and functionality. A separate secondary kitchen with a gas cooktop provides additional preparation and cooking space, making everyday cooking and entertaining more convenient.\r\n\r\nWide sliding doors connect the main living area to the outdoor timber deck, creating a seamless transition between indoor and outdoor living. A separate second lounge offers additional space and flexibility for family relaxation and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe main bedroom features a walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite, while three additional bedrooms offer flexibility for family members and guests. The bathrooms feature contemporary finishes, with a freestanding bathtub adding a touch of luxury.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include a central speaker system, underfloor heating, a separate laundry and a double internal-access garage, enhancing everyday comfort and convenience.\r\n\r\nLocated in Orewa, the home enjoys easy access to Orewa Beach, local schools, parks and shopping amenities, with convenient motorway connections to the North Shore and Auckland City.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson and Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit the next open home. For more information, visit www.vinsonamyandco.nz",
